#, no-wrap
msgid "[Warm-start QAOA with the Optimization Mapper Qiskit addon](/tutorials/warm-start-qaoa)\n"
msgstr "[Optimization Mapper Qiskit addon으로 웜스타트 QAOA 실행하기](/tutorials/warm-start-qaoa)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
