#, no-wrap
msgid "[Enhance feature classification using projected quantum kernels](/tutorials/projected-quantum-kernels)\n"
msgstr "[투영된 양자 커널을 이용한 특징 분류 향상](/tutorials/projected-quantum-kernels)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
